' Shared redraw/caching logic for the SceneGraph shape components under
' `components/Shapes/`. A SceneGraph component's compile scope only includes
' files reachable via `import`, and BrighterScript type-checks a whole
' imported file's dependency graph rather than just members actually called -
' hence importing all of BGE here, once, instead of per component. Relative
' (not `pkg:/`-absolute) paths so this still resolves under any consumer's
' `files` remapping (ropm, this repo's own examples/* copy trick, etc).
